<title>USA: STROUDS INC JULY SAME-STORE SALES UP.</title>
<headline>STROUDS INC JULY SAME-STORE SALES UP.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strouds Inc Thursday said same-store sales for four weeks ended Aug 2 rose 4.6 percent from the year ago period.</p>
<p>Net sales for the period were about $16.8 million versus about 14.9 million one year ago.</p>
<p>Year-to-date same-store sales fell roughly 2.1 percent, Strouds said in a statement.</p>
<p>Year-to-date net sales were about $87.4 million compared to $80.3 million in 1996.</p>
</text>
